  "reason": "Stiff wings: the capture-only build beats its wings 1.0 deg peak to peak (flatFloor 60), jitter 0.43. Finger-fan wingChain (worker A fan v2) plus worker C v3 seam anchor: the folded membrane is welded to the flank down its whole length, and with anchorR 0.2 only the shoulder end of that seam rode the chain parent, so the spread wing tore off the flank into separate panels (v2 defence sheet). anchorR 1.2 anchors the whole seam so the membrane stretches from the flank to the fingers. Side build h3_shadow_dragon_v3: wingRange 125.2, one-piece membranes; pre-delivery jitter 0.363 (judged after fleet_rebuild)."
 },
